# Root CAs trusted by the ACME client (acme.c) for Let's Encrypt and the DNS APIs.
# Taken from the Mozilla CA list. Chains seen 2026-11: Let's Encrypt API -> ISRG Root X2,
# api.cloudflare.com -> GTS Root R4, www.duckdns.org -> Amazon Root CA 1. Others cover
# common chains (ZeroSSL/Sectigo, DigiCert, SSL.com). Other servers: upload an extra CA.
# Also used by push notifications (notify.c). Chains seen 2026-11-22: ntfy.sh -> ISRG Root X2,
# api.pushover.net -> DigiCert Global Root G2, discord.com -> GTS Root R4,
# api.telegram.org -> Go Daddy Root Certificate Authority - G2 (added for it, at the end).
